---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import experience from '../content/experience/_ordered.json';

// ✅ Local portrait as a real asset (no CLS, optimized)
import portrait from '../assets/personal.jpg';

const fmtMY = (iso) =>
  iso ? new Date(iso).toLocaleString('en-US', { month: 'short', year: 'numeric' }) : '';

const cardBase = 'rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden shadow-sm transition-all duration-300';
const card = `${cardBase} hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 p-5`;
---

<Layout
  title="About — Dimitrios Ntempos"
  description="About Dimitrios Ntempos, Technical Product Manager specializing in APIs, integrations, data systems, and structured execution across complex environments."
>
  <!-- Opportunistic prefetch for likely next pages -->
  <link rel="prefetch" href="/projects" />
  <link rel="prefetch" href="/essays" />

  <article>
    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="about">
      <div class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row items-center md:items-start gap-8">
        <!-- Text -->
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h1 id="about" class="text-3xl font-bold mb-1 text-gray-900">About</h1>
          <p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-lg mb-3">
            I am driven by curiosity.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl">
            My path into technology started through curiosity rather than a single discipline. 
            I studied economics and finance, later moved into computer science, and eventually into product management.

            Across these different fields I kept noticing the same underlying patterns: systems, incentives, and the relationships between moving parts. 
            That perspective eventually shaped how I approach product work today.

            I’m particularly interested in complex systems — whether they appear in markets, software architecture, or organizations — and in finding the leverage points that make those systems work better.

            Some of these ideas appear in the <a href="/essays" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">essays</a> I write on this site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Portrait (local Image) -->
        <div data-no-invert class="flex-shrink-0">
          <Image
            src={portrait}
            alt="Portrait of Dimitrios Ntempos"
            width={260}
            height={260}
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-52 h-52 md:w-60 md:h-60 rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-white shadow-md"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Values -->
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="values">
      <h2 id="values" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Values</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
       Every product reflects the values behind it. These are the principles that guide how I work, collaborate, and build; the mix that helps teams create meaningful outcomes and become better with every iteration.
      </p>
      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Simplicity</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            I reduce complexity before adding features. Clear structure scales better than clever solutions, especially in systems that must evolve.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Transparency</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            I share context early — assumptions, trade-offs, and risks. Alignment improves when uncertainty is visible rather than managed quietly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Community</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Strong products emerge from diverse thinking. I value disagreement, structured debate, and collective ownership over individual heroics.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Craftsmanship</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            I treat product work as a craft. That means sharpening judgment, refining systems, and improving execution with every iteration.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Craftsmanship -->
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="professional">
      <h2 id="professional" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Areas of focus</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Over the past decade, I’ve operated within startups and scaleups to design resilient systems, automate workflows, and translate data into measurable outcomes. I’m most effective where product, data, and execution intersect.
      </p>

      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Turning data into decisions</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Designing data pipelines and feedback loops that turn raw information into clear, actionable product decisions.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">SQL</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Plotly</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Sheets</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Systems &amp; integrations</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Connecting platforms through well-defined APIs, events, and automation to reduce friction and increase reliability.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">APIs</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Webhooks</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Sockets</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">SDK</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Documentation that guides</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Writing structured documentation that clarifies intent, reduces ambiguity, and helps teams move faster with confidence.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Notion</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Jira</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Aha</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Docs</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Automation and AI</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Applying automation and AI thoughtfully to remove repetitive work while preserving human judgment where it matters.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">OpenAI</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Python</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Copilot</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Apps Script</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Advocating for UX</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Championing user experience by translating research and feedback into flows that feel simple, coherent, and purposeful.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Figma</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Balsamiq</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">GA4</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class={card}>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Collaborative Execution</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Delivering through structured collaboration, aligning stakeholders early and iterating with clarity and shared ownership.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Agile</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Scrum</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-md font-medium">Kanban</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience -->
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="experience">
      <h2 id="experience" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Latest experience</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Over the years, I’ve led products from concept to scale — shaping strategy, improving systems, and aligning teams around clear outcomes. My work spans data, integrations, and product delivery, always with an eye on creating value that lasts.
      </p>

      <div class="relative">
        <ul class="space-y-8">
          {experience.map((item, i) => (
            <li key={(item.role || item.company) + i} class="relative flex gap-6">
              <!-- Timeline dot -->
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-indigo-300 flex-shrink-0 mt-2.5">
                  {item.current && <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-600 rounded-full animate-ping opacity-75"></div>}
                </div>
                {i < experience.length - 1 && <div class="w-px h-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-200 to-indigo-50 mt-1"></div>}
              </div>

              <!-- Card content -->
              <div class="flex-1 mt-1 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-gray-50/50 border border-gray-200/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 p-5 hover:border-indigo-200/50">
                <!-- Role as main heading -->
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 to-gray-700 bg-clip-text text-transparent">{item.role || '—'}</h3>

                <!-- Company info row -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600">{item.company}</p>
                  {item.current && (
                    <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">
                      Current
                    </span>
                  )}
                </div>

                <!-- Date and location -->
                {(item.start || item.location) && (
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1.5">
                    {item.start && <span>{fmtMY(item.start)}</span>}
                    {item.start && item.location && <span>{' · '}</span>}
                    {item.location && <span>{item.location}</span>}
                  </p>
                )}

                <!-- Description -->
                {item.description && (
                  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3.5 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">{item.description}</p>
                )}

                <!-- Tags -->
                {item.tags?.length > 0 && (
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-gray-100/50">
                    {item.tags.map((tag) => (
                      <span class="text-xs bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-indigo-100 hover:text-indigo-800 transition-colors cursor-default">{tag}</span>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ntemposd"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="View LinkedIn Profile"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium
                bg-indigo-600 text-white hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors
                focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-indigo-400"
        >
          View more on LinkedIn →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-4" aria-labelledby="outside">
      <h2 id="outside" class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Outside of work</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6"">
        Outside of product work I practice and follow basketball closely, explore sports analytics,
        and enjoy studying systems across different domains — from markets to team dynamics.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
